# PostgreSQL test environment

When tests need a live PostgreSQL database, use this repo's Compose setup. Do not apt-install Postgres, start a one-off cluster, or invent a DSN.

```bash
make postgres-up          # docker-compose.postgres.yml
make test-api-postgres    # sets LISTELLO_TEST_POSTGRES_DSN and runs API tests
make postgres-down
```

Live tests skip unless `LISTELLO_TEST_POSTGRES_DSN` is set. `make test` / `make test-api` stay SQLite-only. The GitHub Actions `test-postgres` job runs `make test-api-postgres`.
